We are using DECwindows on a 3100 and 5100.  Our software works
just fine under mwm.  We keep track of when we are being iconified
and provide the users the ability to iconify windows.

dxwm is giving us fits.  We are able to keep track of when we are
iconified and deiconified by catching property changes on the
WM_STATE property.  The problem is: we can't iconify windows (or
deiconify).

