There are many sources of information about VMS.  You can, of course, get
some types of information from your friendly DEC salesbeing.  Otherwise:

Professional Press sells a line of books about VMS, two of which are

 -  "Introduction to VAX/VMS" by David W. Bynon and Terry C. Shannon
    (239 pp., $35)

