    Professional Press Books
    101 Witmer Rd.
    P.O. Box 446
    Horsham, Pennsylvania 19044 USA

voice: +1 215/957-1500 (orders within USA)
voice: +1 215/957-4265 (international inquiries)
  fax: +1 215/957-1050

Domestic shipping and handling: $3.00 first volume, $1.00 additional
volumes.  Residents of the Keystone State add 6% tax.  Credit
card orders accepted.

Besides reading books, you should get in touch with your local
manifestation of DECUS, the Digital Equipment Computer Users Society.
In Anaheim, you are blessed with being near the site of the U.S.
Chapter Symposium, which will occur there beginning 5 December 1992.
DECUS Local User Group (LUG) meetings also occur periodically.

There are many options for file transfer and e-mail between VMS
systems and other platforms.  Since you are a Unix site, you might
look into the DECUS UUCP package as a beginning.  The package is
big, so you would want to get it on tape from some source, such as
the LUG tape coordinator.
