>we don't seem to have the 'tell' command, only the manual page!

  I think that 'tell' is in the 'Unsupported Software' section of the
DECnet setld kits. If you can find that, set up a proxy login for yourself
on vms, a command file, e.g. decterm.com containing:-

  $ set display/create/transport=decnet/node=ds
  $ create/term/detach/window=(title="vms",icon="vms")

and commands of the form "tell vms @decterm &" should be all you need.

  I use the above in my .mwmrc file as:-
	Uproar f.exec "tell uproar @decterm &"
    to create a window from the root menu.

