In the case of the TZ85, you must take a deliberate action to enable
code update. This is done by holding a button for an unusually long
period of time, waiting for a blinking light and then re-pushing the
button.

This does not make the process fool-proof but it does eliminate the
situation where soneone's drive gets updated without "prior consent".

Mickey.


