I noticed your smiley, but I do have a comment/question on HP and
IBM's commitment to OSF. While I will agree that HP and IBM have
contributed a considerable amount of software and resources to OSF,
particularly to OSF/Motif and OSF DME, their commitment to OSF/1 seems
to be marginal at best. I know IBM ships it on the ES/9000, but where
