would suggest is Mach. Frankly, that makes me concerned about whether
OSF/1 will be able to make a significant impact on the UN*X
marketplace. Anyone out there from HP and/or IBM care to comment on
why you are dragging your heals in supporting OSF/1? I recall lots of
